  "author": "古河云科技",
  "content": "<p data-track=\"1\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:#222222;font-family:\"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", \"wenquanyi micro hei\", \"helvetica neue\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px;text-align:justify;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;margin-bottom:20px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;letter-spacing:1px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:#000000;--tt-darkmode-color:#a3a3a3;\">智慧园区借助云计算、物联网、大数据、人工智能和移动互联网等尖端技术和管理模式，打破传统的信息壁垒，</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:700;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:#1578ff;--tt-darkmode-color:#1578ff;\">从“智能管理”和“智能服务”两大维度出发，打造综合园区运营管理平台。</span></span>全面展示园区、楼宇、设备、管路以及环境监测等各种实时信息，旨在推动园区经济转型升级、提升经济增长质量。</span></p><p data-track=\"2\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:#222222;font-family:\"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", \"wenquanyi micro hei\", \"helvetica neue\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px;text-align:justify;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;margin-bottom:20px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;letter-spacing:1px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:#000000;--tt-darkmode-color:#a3a3a3;\">智慧园区的建设需要将园内基础设施层、数据平台层、应用服务层、运营管理层、决策优化层的信息有效融合，构建园区的“智慧大脑”。</span></span></p><div class=\"pgc-img\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:18px 0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:#222222;font-family:\"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", \"wenquanyi micro hei\", \"helvetica neue\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px;text-align:justify;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\"><img src=\"https://p3-sign.toutiaoimg.com/tos-cn-i-6w9my0ksvp/e97c3dda29bb4828aeab82d6a6f48a0e~tplv-tt-origin-asy2:5aS05p2hQOWPpOays-S6keenkeaKgA==.image?_iz=58558&amp;from=article.pc_detail&amp;x-expires=1695622258&amp;x-signature=%2FdVTqcz%2FmgF8u7y0NWyILI65DHU%3D\" img_width=\"1000\" img_height=\"561\" image_type=\"1\" mime_type=\"image/png\" web_uri=\"tos-cn-i-6w9my0ksvp/e97c3dda29bb4828aeab82d6a6f48a0e\" class=\"syl-page-img\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border:0px;margin:0px auto 8px;padding:0px;cursor:zoom-in;max-width:100%;display:block;border-radius:4px;height:auto;\" /><p class=\"pgc-img-caption\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;margin-bottom:0px !important;\"><br /></p></div><div class=\"pgc-img\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:18px 0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:#222222;font-family:\"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", \"wenquanyi micro hei\", \"helvetica neue\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px;text-align:justify;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\"><img src=\"https://p3-sign.toutiaoimg.com/tos-cn-i-6w9my0ksvp/3f27d86178b94b7891052242a7f8b41b~tplv-tt-origin-asy2:5aS05p2hQOWPpOays-S6keenkeaKgA==.image?_iz=58558&amp;from=article.pc_detail&amp;x-expires=1695622258&amp;x-signature=n2h0saDNOmAOq0CcmBaggAZquog%3D\" img_width=\"1080\" img_height=\"132\" image_type=\"1\" mime_type=\"image/png\" web_uri=\"tos-cn-i-6w9my0ksvp/3f27d86178b94b7891052242a7f8b41b\" class=\"syl-page-img\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border:0px;margin:0px auto 8px;padding:0px;cursor:zoom-in;max-width:100%;display:block;border-radius:4px;height:auto;\" /><p class=\"pgc-img-caption\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;margin-bottom:0px !important;\"><br /></p></div><p data-track=\"3\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:#222222;font-family:\"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", \"wenquanyi micro hei\", \"helvetica neue\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;text-align:center;margin-bottom:20px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;letter-spacing:1px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:700;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:#1578ff;--tt-darkmode-color:#1578ff;\">基础设施层</span></span></span></p><p data-track=\"4\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:#222222;font-family:\"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", \"wenquanyi micro hei\", \"helvetica neue\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px;text-align:justify;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;margin-bottom:20px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;letter-spacing:1px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:#000000;--tt-darkmode-color:#a3a3a3;\">园区物理设施如建筑物、道路、绿化以及水电气的各项基础设施，网络设施如物联网、云计算、5G等信息网络在这里不断交织。这些元素彼此相连，相互依赖，构建了一个高效便捷的园区生态系统，为每一位居民提供着最基础的服务。</span></span></p><div class=\"pgc-img\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:18px 0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:#222222;font-family:\"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", \"wenquanyi micro hei\", \"helvetica neue\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px;text-align:justify;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\"><img src=\"https://p3-sign.toutiaoimg.com/tos-cn-i-6w9my0ksvp/e6ed079fcd3246ce976daa28009db6a6~tplv-tt-origin-asy2:5aS05p2hQOWPpOays-S6keenkeaKgA==.image?_iz=58558&amp;from=article.pc_detail&amp;x-expires=1695622258&amp;x-signature=BipJ069qmxDsuP1eLmMBB%2BqZtbw%3D\" img_width=\"1080\" img_height=\"132\" image_type=\"1\" mime_type=\"image/png\" web_uri=\"tos-cn-i-6w9my0ksvp/e6ed079fcd3246ce976daa28009db6a6\" class=\"syl-page-img\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border:0px;margin:0px auto 8px;padding:0px;cursor:zoom-in;max-width:100%;display:block;border-radius:4px;height:auto;\" /><p class=\"pgc-img-caption\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;margin-bottom:0px !important;\"><br /></p></div><p data-track=\"5\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:#222222;font-family:\"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", \"wenquanyi micro hei\", \"helvetica neue\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;text-align:center;margin-bottom:20px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;letter-spacing:1px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:700;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:#1578ff;--tt-darkmode-color:#1578ff;\">数据平台层</span></span></span></p><p data-track=\"6\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:#222222;font-family:\"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", \"wenquanyi micro hei\", \"helvetica neue\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px;text-align:justify;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;margin-bottom:20px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;letter-spacing:1px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:#000000;--tt-darkmode-color:#a3a3a3;\">以“开河”平台为基础，从物理环境中获取数据，再到储存、处理和呈现，这一整个流程中，依赖着古河云科技的一系列创新技术。传感器、摄像头、网关等各种设备作为信息源泉，源源不断地为我们提供宝贵的数据。在这个过程中，</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:700;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:#1578ff;--tt-darkmode-color:#1578ff;\">古河云科技还拥有数据仓库、数据湖和数据分析等强大的工具，</span></span>帮助我们深度挖掘数据的潜在价值。这些工具和技术不仅确保了我们能够更好地理解物理世界，也让我们能够更有效地预测和改变未来。</span></p><div class=\"pgc-img\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:18px 0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:#222222;font-family:\"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", \"wenquanyi micro hei\", \"helvetica neue\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px;text-align:justify;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\"><img src=\"https://p26-sign.toutiaoimg.com/tos-cn-i-6w9my0ksvp/e6033270c82d4dca8ca8af3f4f650748~tplv-tt-origin-asy2:5aS05p2hQOWPpOays-S6keenkeaKgA==.image?_iz=58558&amp;from=article.pc_detail&amp;x-expires=1695622258&amp;x-signature=K6SdaUcAHxuh%2BCc98oFRpsOow1Y%3D\" img_width=\"1024\" img_height=\"683\" image_type=\"1\" mime_type=\"image/jpeg\" web_uri=\"tos-cn-i-6w9my0ksvp/e6033270c82d4dca8ca8af3f4f650748\" class=\"syl-page-img\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border:0px;margin:0px auto 8px;padding:0px;cursor:zoom-in;max-width:100%;display:block;border-radius:4px;height:auto;\" /><p class=\"pgc-img-caption\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;margin-bottom:0px !important;\"><br /></p></div><div class=\"pgc-img\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:18px 0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:#222222;font-family:\"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", \"wenquanyi micro hei\", \"helvetica neue\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px;text-align:justify;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;\"><img src=\"https://p3-sign.toutiaoimg.com/tos-cn-i-6w9my0ksvp/744c76701d1c44f5ac8805bf85535790~tplv-tt-origin-asy2:5aS05p2hQOWPpOays-S6keenkeaKgA==.image?_iz=58558&amp;from=article.pc_detail&amp;x-expires=1695622258&amp;x-signature=3elzP4M2WQZ4vD6PxXS%2BwP0Rssk%3D\" img_width=\"1080\" img_height=\"132\" image_type=\"1\" mime_type=\"image/png\" web_uri=\"tos-cn-i-6w9my0ksvp/744c76701d1c44f5ac8805bf85535790\" class=\"syl-page-img\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;border:0px;margin:0px auto 8px;padding:0px;cursor:zoom-in;max-width:100%;display:block;border-radius:4px;height:auto;\" /><p class=\"pgc-img-caption\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;margin-bottom:0px !important;\"><br /></p></div><p data-track=\"7\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:#222222;font-family:\"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", \"wenquanyi micro hei\", \"helvetica neue\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;text-align:center;margin-bottom:20px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;letter-spacing:1px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:700;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:#1578ff;--tt-darkmode-color:#1578ff;\">应用服务层</span></span></span></p><p data-track=\"8\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:#222222;font-family:\"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", \"wenquanyi micro hei\", \"helvetica neue\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px;text-align:justify;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;margin-bottom:20px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;letter-spacing:1px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:#000000;--tt-darkmode-color:#a3a3a3;\">古河云科技将大数据技术与物联网、边缘计算、区块链等其他先进技术相结合，构建更完善的智慧园区解决方案。将最前沿的技术和理念融入实际应用中，深耕8大场景，</span><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:700;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:#1578ff;--tt-darkmode-color:#1578ff;\">涵盖了安防监控、能源管理、交通导航、环境治理、企业运行以及智慧政务等各类应用场景。</span></span>为您打造高效、智能的未来园区！</span></p><p data-track=\"9\" style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin-top:20px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:#222222;font-family:\"pingfang sc\", \"hiragino sans gb\", \"microsoft yahei\", \"wenquanyi micro hei\", \"helvetica neue\", arial, sans-serif;font-size:18px;text-wrap:wrap;background-color:#ffffff;margin-bottom:20px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;font-weight:700;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;color:#ffffff;--tt-darkmode-color:#ffffff;\"><span style=\"box-sizing:border-box;margin:0px;padding:0px;border:0px;back